    - class_name: str               Model class name (e.g. "KirinGeoModel")
    - entity_class: str             Entity class name
    - bone_animations: list         List of bone animation dicts

  Each bone animation dict has:
    - bone_var: str                 Java variable name for the bone
    - bone_name: str                GeckoLib bone name
    - rotation_x: str|none         Java expression for X rotation (radians)
